"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a fetish for \"women's adultery\", and so he gets excited with both \"netori\" and \"netorare\". He is Asami's ex-boyfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65073"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「奪」の男優兼カメラマン兼ＡＤ。女の裏切りに興奮する性癖があり、そのため寝取り、寝取られどちらもいける。いっそ自分が当事者でなくてもいいという、ちょっと困った部分も。このために「奪」の裏の仕事に惹かれ、離れられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"半年前の仕事を経て、より「奪」の深みに足を踏み入れようと決意。自ら積極的に女を堕とすことに挑戦する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6182","sourceWorkId":"21645","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻美的前男友。他由于当摄影师的梦想，而在一家视频制作公司工作。但由于涉及一名女性的丑闻，公司破产。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在他难以重新就业的时候，“夺”接受了他。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为新手，他做过各种各样的工作，不仅兼职助理导演，有时甚至当AV演员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他对看人妻出轨有特殊癖好，对“netori”和“netorare”都很兴奋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195883"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5482c428d1ee9ce228027bbcc832183e77ec8c8191c292be9650949922600ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0dfaca82aa6b4bc23442d725b4e5b98be44dce79bd63738403a3202db9fc8b0.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29439","characterName":"露口 愛海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29439"},"originalCharacterName":"露口 愛海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A manager at Ubai who handles the makeup of actresses, lighting, and sometimes camera work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also works as a model and has nude pictures of her taken, but without showing her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her work in the other Ubai includes scouting, client relations, and investigation. For some reason, she can sniff out women who can potentially work at Ubai, or people who might be interested in becoming members. She was also the one who found Ryousuke and recruited him to work under her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She looks at society with mocking eyes, and is a sarcastic person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Ubai Again, she incited Ryousuke, and will decide whether he has what it takes to follow through Gen's footsteps."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Manami is a child born from the adultery of her mother with Gen. She uses this info as blackmail to have sex with Gen whenever she wants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/8139ad850a60762f818135bfb0781b0ddb67926e43774b0e2b8eda39bdf9446a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90543a5a8ffbdbef7f54ba4482967285c759719ff4021e448baae0cfd8cd7266.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68447","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65190","characterName":"ゲンさん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65190"},"originalCharacterName":"ゲンさん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"50-60 years old."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious old man whose real name, age, and history are unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Ubai, he mostly works as a director, and is a senior of Ryousuke. He's a renowned veteran in the industry, that even the company president respects him a lot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's slim and bony, but has a youthful body, and he himself completely shaved off his head."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Known for his legendary sex technique and large penis, but recently he's been busy rearing his possible successors, and so he's having Ryousuke appear in quite a lot of videos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He trusts Ryousuke to an extent, and thus he doesn't say anything with the way Ryousuke does his job."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His hobby from long ago was to seduce another man's woman. He's known to have impregnated lots of wives and fiancees in the past."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65190"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fed5ba43bdcede54e3a2615f2dd07a6cf49bc2754dfc95e78b79714b4af42044.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42a959190c62e6dc16cba77ceb7c922eade5ec4b7b6de28739f2fd00cb435886.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65191","characterName":"露口 啓司","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65191"},"originalCharacterName":"露口 啓司","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The father of Manami. Looks like a good man, at least from the outside."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Holds quite a high position at a major bank, and is the founder of Ubai organization."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After discovering that Gen had carnal relations with the wife he just marri